# Mobile (Flutter)

## Structure

- `lib/app/` — app shell, router, theme
- `lib/core/` — shared utilities, network, constants
- `lib/features/<name>/` — feature modules (data/domain/presentation)

## State & navigation

- Riverpod for state management
- GoRouter for routing
- Dio for HTTP (`/api/v1/` base URL from env/config)

## Code style

- `flutter analyze` must pass
- Prefer `const` constructors
- No `print()` — use proper logging

## Testing

- Unit/widget tests in `test/`
- Run `flutter test`

## Platform folders

If `android/` or `ios/` missing, run:
`flutter create . --org uz.livecommerce --project-name livecommerce_mobile`
